00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:31.100
to communicate that the marketing spend

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:35.620
correlates with the unit
price, but not with the volume?

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:38.330
What chart type would you choose here?

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:41.100
And again, take a break,
