be a clear correlation

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.930
between the volume sold
and the marketing mix.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:24.110
You see large bubbles,

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.860
both on the left and on the
right side of the spectrum.

